# ── [5/8] Full-chain verify BEFORE the checkpoint download ──
# Imports every module of the eval chain (the console script's own module, the policy + its processor,
# RoboTwin's planner with CuRobo, every task of the plan) and then builds one real env and resets it on GPU:
# SAPIEN Vulkan cameras, CuRobo planners and the assets all have to work. Lazily imported modules are
# exactly where earlier first runs died, hence the explicit list instead of `import lerobot`.
log "[5/8] Verifying the full eval chain (imports + one RoboTwin reset on GPU)..."
